            "line": 86,
            "text": "theorem partialR_pullback (d : ℝ) (vr vt : Plane) (F : Lift → ℝ) (q : Plane)\n    (hr : q.1 ≠ 0) (hF : DifferentiableAt ℝ F (graph d vr vt q)) :\n    partialR (pullback d vr vt F) q = radialOp d vr F (graph d vr vt q)"
